@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About VIIDII</PageTitle>

<div class="about-container">
    
    <!-- Natural Glass Header -->
    <div class="about-header">
        <div class="about-eyebrow">Platform Overview</div>
        <h1>About VIIDII</h1>
        <p>Low-bandwidth virtual workspaces, roster-authenticated attendance, and verified cohort rooms.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- The Mission -->
    <div class="content-section">
        <h2>The Mission</h2>
        <p>
            VIIDII was engineered specifically to solve the biggest breakdowns of conventional meeting tools 
            in emerging markets: prohibitive data costs, unstable network connections, and unverified "ghost attendees."
        </p>
        <p>
            Instead of treating meetings as disposable, high-bandwidth video streams, VIIDII acts as a 
            <strong>structured digital facility</strong>. It enables bootcamps, universities, professional bodies, 
            and remote teams to rent persistent, low-bandwidth spaces with verified identity and indisputable 
            attendance proof.
        </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Capabilities Grid -->
    <div class="content-section">
        <h2>Core Platform Capabilities</h2>
        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Roster-Gated Access</h3>
                <p>Upload candidate lists via CSV. Approved students and members join with zero password friction while unauthorized guests are kept out.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Low-Bandwidth Adaptive Streaming</h3>
                <p>Powered by LiveKit WebRTC SFU with intelligent Data Saver mode, reducing data consumption by up to 90% compared to standard video calls.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Network Drop Grace Period</h3>
                <p>Unstable power or network switches trigger a 5-minute grace buffer, preserving the user’s seat, attendance score, and chat state without dropping them.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Expected vs. Present Roster</h3>
                <p>Hosts see a live dual-column dashboard showing who has connected and who is still absent, with 1-click reminders.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Verified Attendance Dossiers</h3>
                <p>Indisputable time-in-room metrics and presence tracking, ready for 1-click CSV or audited PDF compliance exports.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Universal Space Presets</h3>
                <p>Pre-configured spaces tailored for Cohort Bootcamps, University Lectures, Executive Workshops, and Exam Halls.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Architecture & Tech Stack -->
    <div class="content-section">
        <h2>Technical Architecture</h2>
        <p>
            VIIDII is built on a high-throughput, modular Microsoft .NET 10 stack designed for reliability and minimal cloud egress:
        </p>
        <div class="tech-stack">
            <span class="tech-badge">.NET 10</span>
            <span class="tech-badge">Blazor Interactive Server</span>
            <span class="tech-badge">LiveKit WebRTC SFU</span>
            <span class="tech-badge">SignalR Realtime</span>
            <span class="tech-badge">Entity Framework Core</span>
            <span class="tech-badge">Google OAuth 2.0</span>
            <span class="tech-badge">Cloudflare Zero Trust Tunnel</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Who It Serves -->
    <div class="content-section">
        <h2>Who Uses VIIDII?</h2>
        <p>
            <strong>Tech Bootcamps & Training Academies:</strong> Run daily multi-hour classes without burning students' data budgets or dealing with rogue link sharing.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>Professional Accreditation Councils:</strong> Conduct mandatory Continuing Professional Development (CPD) sessions with verifiable attendance records for license renewal.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>Universities & Higher Education:</strong> Manage large lecture cohorts, attendance quotas, and exam clearances with automated records.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>Distributed Remote Teams:</strong> Collaborate in lightweight, persistent team spaces without video exhaustion.
        </p>
    </div>

</div>

